OL,3,GNEWSAMigrants taken to Dover after more
OL,4,Athan 30 hours at sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish rescue boats were sent to
OL,7,Fcollect those on board, who were then
OL,8,Ftransferred to Border Security Command.
